# Wave T55 (Wildreach kit): hardpanfloor — Wildreach's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). HARD-PACKED SAND-AND-GRAVEL: pale khaki-tan packed earth with fine gravel speckle, sparse pale pebbles and faint wind streaks — the painting's pale sand roads in the game's one pixel family. A FINE ORGANIC PACKED-EARTH SCATTER: unlike Fenland's walkfloor (pegged timber planks), Clashfield's basaltfloor (fitted dark slabs), Bridgeport's ringfloor (ringed quay stone), Brightshore's panelfloor (rigid golden grid). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T55-WILDREACH-PLAN.md §5.)
